  "BR-Z-06": ["On a document-level allowance with cac:TaxCategory/cbc:ID (BT-95) = Z, set cbc:Percent (BT-96) to 0.","Su uno sconto di documento con cac:TaxCategory/cbc:ID (BT-95) = Z, imposta cbc:Percent (BT-96) a 0."],
  "BR-Z-07": ["On a document-level charge with cac:TaxCategory/cbc:ID (BT-102) = Z, set cbc:Percent (BT-103) to 0.","Su una maggiorazione di documento con cac:TaxCategory/cbc:ID (BT-102) = Z, imposta cbc:Percent (BT-103) a 0."],
  "BR-Z-08": ["For the Z cac:TaxSubtotal, cbc:TaxableAmount (BT-116) = sum of Z line amounts (BT-131) + Z document charges (BT-99) − Z document allowances (BT-92).","Per il cac:TaxSubtotal Z, cbc:TaxableAmount (BT-116) = somma importi riga Z (BT-131) + maggiorazioni documento Z (BT-99) − sconti documento Z (BT-92)."],
